// What the codex says about an amulet. The drawing itself is built in,
// or comes from a picture in images/amulets/ with the same name as the id.
{
	"id": "sara",
	"name": "Son of Ra",
	"plural": "titles “Son of Ra”",
	"meaning": "“Son of Ra”, written with a pintail duck (sa, “son”) and the sun's disc. From the Fourth Dynasty on, kings wrote this title before their birth name."
}
